Rightly so.

219
00:16:42,261 --> 00:16:44,260
Let's start with the site description.

220
00:16:44,261 --> 00:16:48,260
I did wonder if we could
just cut that altogether.

221
00:16:48,909 --> 00:16:51,260
Everyone on the module knows the site.

222
00:16:51,359 --> 00:16:53,260
We all went there on the same day.

223
00:16:53,609 --> 00:16:55,260
Your external examiner didn't, though.

224
00:16:55,261 --> 00:16:57,260
